### Register an organiser
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Organiser",
  "email": "organiser@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "ORGANISER"
}

### Login as organiser
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "organiser@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

